# PipeCrew — this directory hosts PipeCrew-managed repos

<!-- pipecrew:root-dispatcher — this file was placed by PipeCrew (/discover or /join) at the parent directory of a workspace's repos, so every agent session launched in or below it picks up this guidance (AGENTS.md is the tool-agnostic context standard; the one-line CLAUDE.md shim beside it imports it into Claude Code). Everything outside the pipecrew:workspaces block is yours to edit; the blocks between those markers are regenerated by scripts/sync-root-claude.js and will be overwritten. -->

The repos under this directory belong to one or more PipeCrew workspaces (listed below). Each workspace carries durable platform context, generated domain agents, and run history. **For any non-trivial task on these repos, prefer dispatching the PipeCrew skills and agents below over doing the work by hand** — they load the workspace's platform context, conventions, and institutional history that a plain session doesn't have.

